{"header":{"status":{"name":"Success","code":0,"description":"Query success","apiHelp":"https://www.censtatd.gov.hk/tc/web_table.html?id=340-45022&api_popup=1"},"title":"港元利息結算率","tablenote":["港元利息結算率由香港銀行公會提供及擁有。每日港元利息結算率是根據香港銀行公會港元利率套戥協議條款，按香港銀行同業市場港元存款的市場利率來釐定。香港銀行公會一般會在每個營業日（星期六除外）早上 11 時 15 分在其網站上發布該天港元利息結算率，並以香港銀行公會指定的 12 至 20 間參考銀行所提供的報價資料作為釐定基礎。計算方法是從參考銀行的報價中剔除最高與最低各三個報價，然後取其平均數。     數字會根據認可機構所提交的修訂資料而作出按月修訂。","N.A. 沒有數字"],"source":"香港金融管理局 如欲獲取更多資料，請瀏覽香港金融管理局網站(www.hkma.gov.hk/chi)。 (查詢電話：2878 8222  查詢電郵：hkma@hkma.gov.hk)","count":{"noOfRecords":20}},"dataSet":[{"MATURITY":"0N","MATURITYDesc":"隔夜","freq":"Y","period":"1996","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":"","sd_value":"N.A."},{"MATURITY":"1M","MATURITYDesc":"1 個月","freq":"Y","period":"1996","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.48,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"1W","MATURITYDesc":"1星期","freq":"Y","period":"1996","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":"","sd_value":"N.A."},{"MATURITY":"3M","MATURITYDesc":"3 個月","freq":"Y","period":"1996","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.61,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"6M","MATURITYDesc":"6 個月","freq":"Y","period":"1996","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.7,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"0N","MATURITYDesc":"隔夜","freq":"Q","period":"199609","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":"","sd_value":"N.A."},{"MATURITY":"1M","MATURITYDesc":"1 個月","freq":"Q","period":"199609","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.46,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"1W","MATURITYDesc":"1星期","freq":"Q","period":"199609","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":"","sd_value":"N.A."},{"MATURITY":"3M","MATURITYDesc":"3 個月","freq":"Q","period":"199609","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.64,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"6M","MATURITYDesc":"6 個月","freq":"Q","period":"199609","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","figure":5.88,"sd_value":""},{"MATURITY":"0N","MATURITYDesc":"隔夜","freq":"Y","period":"2025","sv":"SET_RATE","svDesc":"期末息率(年率)","f